%% CanvasEdit session lifecycle state diagram
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle

  state "Idle / no edit session" as Idle
  note right of Idle
    No DraftDocument, TouchedSet, CommitPlan,
    or live CanvasEdit handle exists.
  end note

  Idle --> Rejected: edit(fn) after runtime dispose / StateError
  Idle --> Rejected: closed handle operation / StateError
  Idle --> Session: edit(fn) while runtime active

  state "Rejected before session" as Rejected
  note right of Rejected
    Disposed and stale-handle operations fail before
    draft creation. No install, revision, cache,
    repaint, notification, or action effect is allowed.
  end note
  Rejected --> Idle: exception propagated

  state "Open synchronous session" as Session {
    [*] --> Opening

    state "Open draft and live handle" as Opening
    note right of Opening
      Read the committed revision snapshot, create a
      rollback-safe draft, create an empty touched set,
      and bind the live CanvasEdit handle to this session.
      No legacy SceneController, SceneWriteTxn, NodeSpec,
      or PatchField entity participates.
    end note

    Opening --> CallbackExecuting: invoke fn(handle)

    state "Callback executing" as CallbackExecuting
    CallbackExecuting --> CallbackExecuting: synchronous CanvasEdit mutation / mutate draft and record touched facts
    CallbackExecuting --> CallbackExecuting: nested edit(fn) attempt / throw StateError; no nested session opens
    CallbackExecuting --> Rollback: callback throws or handle mutation fails
    CallbackExecuting --> FutureRejected: callback returns Future
    CallbackExecuting --> CallbackReturned: callback returns normal value

    state "Future return rejected" as FutureRejected
    note right of FutureRejected
      Async edit is rejected before commit planning.
      No mutation may outlive the synchronous session.
    end note
    FutureRejected --> Rollback: treat as failed edit

    state "Callback returned normally" as CallbackReturned
    CallbackReturned --> NoOpDecision: inspect touched set

    state NoOpDecision <<choice>>
    NoOpDecision --> NoOpEmptyTouched: touched set is empty
    NoOpDecision --> CommitPlanning: touched set is non-empty

    state "No-op empty touched set" as NoOpEmptyTouched
    note right of NoOpEmptyTouched
      No atomic install. No document, structural, bounds,
      visual, projection, selection, resource, preview,
      or overlay revision changes. No cache eviction,
      public notification, text edit event, scene repaint,
      overlay repaint, or action.
    end note
    NoOpEmptyTouched --> CloseNoOp: close session

    state "Commit planning" as CommitPlanning
    CommitPlanning --> Preflight: compile exact revisions, invalidation, repaint intent

    state "Preflight" as Preflight
    Preflight --> Rollback: invariant, validation, or admission failure
    Preflight --> AtomicInstall: preflight accepted

    state "Rollback discard" as Rollback
    note left of Rollback
      Discard draft, touched set, buffered events,
      repaint requests, spatial deltas, resource effects,
      and projection/cache effects. Committed document
      identity and all revisions remain unchanged.
    end note
    Rollback --> CloseRollback: close session

    state "Atomic install" as AtomicInstall
    note right of AtomicInstall
      This is the only commit boundary.
      Public notifications are not allowed before this state.
    end note
    AtomicInstall --> PostCommitEffects: replace committed tables and revision state

    state "Post-commit effects" as PostCommitEffects
    note right of PostCommitEffects
      Apply exact spatial deltas, projection/resource cache
      invalidation, repaint buses, and public state effects
      after install. Low-level CanvasEdit emits no user action event.
    end note
    PostCommitEffects --> CloseCommitted: effects staged after install

    state "Close and mark handle stale" as CloseCommitted
    state "Close stale handle after rollback" as CloseRollback
    state "Close stale handle after no-op" as CloseNoOp

    CloseCommitted --> NotifyPublic: handle closed
    CloseNoOp --> ReturnResult: handle closed
    CloseRollback --> RethrowFailure: handle closed

    state "Publish public notifications" as NotifyPublic
    note right of NotifyPublic
      Reachable only after atomic install.
      CanvasRuntimeState and repaint notifications observe
      committed state, never draft state.
    end note
    NotifyPublic --> ReturnResult: return callback result

    state "Return callback result" as ReturnResult
    state "Rethrow failure" as RethrowFailure

    ReturnResult --> [*]
    RethrowFailure --> [*]
  }

  Session --> Idle: session finished

  note left of Session
    Negative invariants:
    rollback and no-op never install;
    rollback and no-op do not change revisions,
    caches, repaint buses, public notifications,
    text edit streams, or user action streams;
    stale handle operations throw StateError;
    nested edit is rejected;
    Future-returning edit is rejected;
    no legacy entities are part of the lifecycle.
  end note
